nostra capacità di giudizio."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"A novelist attends the trial of a woman accused of killing her 15-month-old daughter by abandoning her to the rising tide on a beach in northern France. But as the trial continues, her own family history, doubts, and fears about motherhood are steadily dislodged as the life story of the accused is gradually revealed."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Rama, romancière d’une trentaine d’années, assiste au procès de Laurence Coly aux assises de Saint-Omer. Celle-ci est accusée d’avoir tué sa fille de quinze mois en l’abandonnant sur une plage du nord de la France, au moment où la marée montait. De cette histoire, Rama voudrait écrire une adaptation contemporaine du mythe antique de Médée. Mais au cours du procès, rien ne se passe comme prévu. C’est finalement son propre rapport à la maternité que le huis clos du procès vient questionner.","tagline":"Inspiré d'une histoire vraie"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ducP5qwO0BnowVJxiqqneMct4Zv.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aX1VH6SowCM3IezI09VqZjIuWiS.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":925943,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ducP5qwO0BnowVJxiqqneMct4Zv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ducP5qwO0BnowVJxiqqneMct4Zv.jpg","language":"it","width":1984,"height":2835},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ducP5qwO0BnowVJxiqqneMct4Zv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ducP5qwO0BnowVJxiqqneMct4Zv.jpg","language":"it","width":1984,"height":2835}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/43YbWCYPKcSmZ1L9NiVv19np2mT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/43YbWCYPK